{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00141",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.14,
      "end_seconds": 7.62,
      "duration_seconds": 6.48,
      "text": "Hmm, you know, good afternoon, doctor, the receptionist said you'd see me now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.22,
      "end_seconds": 13.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Of course, put it down anywhere. So, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 13.85,
      "end_seconds": 17.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor. I came along to help out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.1,
      "end_seconds": 22.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "So, yes, that's no problem at all. Please sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.23,
      "end_seconds": 35.99,
      "duration_seconds": 12.76,
      "text": "Uh, mainly a red swollen area on my leg. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.53,
      "end_seconds": 39.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "How long has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.69,
      "end_seconds": 51.43,
      "duration_seconds": 11.74,
      "text": "It's been going on for about two weeks. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.8,
      "end_seconds": 56.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.29,
      "end_seconds": 67.28,
      "duration_seconds": 8.99,
      "text": "Elevating the leg helps a bit. It just comes and goes. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.86,
      "end_seconds": 72.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "I was just going to say that the main thing is—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 72.39,
      "end_seconds": 78.6,
      "duration_seconds": 6.21,
      "text": "Sorry to cut in, doctor, quick question: shall I bring the trolley in now or later?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.96,
      "end_seconds": 82.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Right, later, thanks. Please go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.64,
      "end_seconds": 89.94,
      "duration_seconds": 6.3,
      "text": "Oh, and a small cut that wasn't healing. That's been about the same, five days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.27,
      "end_seconds": 95.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any red streaks going up the leg or pus?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.84,
      "end_seconds": 107.62,
      "duration_seconds": 10.78,
      "text": "No, you know, no red streaks going up the leg, no pus. I did have chills at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.7,
      "end_seconds": 109.46,
      "duration_seconds": 0.76,
      "text": "Any vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.08,
      "end_seconds": 111.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "No. No vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 112.64,
      "end_seconds": 117.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Actually, you know, doctor, I did notice vomiting. She doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.22,
      "end_seconds": 124.6,
      "duration_seconds": 6.38,
      "text": "Hmm, you know, no, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.13,
      "end_seconds": 134.03,
      "duration_seconds": 7.9,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. Have you had any numbness around it or shortness of breath?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.71,
      "end_seconds": 140.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "Well, no numbness around it or shortness of breath, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.9,
      "end_seconds": 144.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Okay, anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.59,
      "end_seconds": 146.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 146.85,
      "end_seconds": 155.35,
      "duration_seconds": 8.5,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. BP is 124 over 71, temperature is 39.2 degrees, saturation 95 percent, pulse is 105 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.81,
      "end_seconds": 159.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Okay, noted. What medicines do you take regularly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.98,
      "end_seconds": 167.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "It's a... um, I can't remember what it's called. It's a little pink tablet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.53,
      "end_seconds": 170.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.54,
      "end_seconds": 184.91,
      "duration_seconds": 13.37,
      "text": "Yeah, for my sugar, I believe. My son sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given. I'm on apixaban, 5 milligrams, maybe, twice a day for the heart rhythm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.68,
      "end_seconds": 188.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Is the packet here, or the prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.55,
      "end_seconds": 196.09,
      "duration_seconds": 6.54,
      "text": "So, not with me. I'll bring it next time. It's paracetamol, 500 milligrams, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 197.25,
      "end_seconds": 201.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 1000 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.01,
      "end_seconds": 206.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Okay. Have you got the newest prescription or the box with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.91,
      "end_seconds": 209.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "No, I left it at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.23,
      "end_seconds": 214.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.0,
      "end_seconds": 219.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "I've, I've had diabetes for nearly five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.5,
      "end_seconds": 221.2,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.07,
      "end_seconds": 231.2,
      "duration_seconds": 9.13,
      "text": "I've had an irregular heartbeat, yes. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.37,
      "end_seconds": 236.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Alright, have you had any surgery before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.46,
      "end_seconds": 240.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Yes, I had a hernia repair, about five years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.47,
      "end_seconds": 243.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "Right, and alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.93,
      "end_seconds": 246.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "I don't drink at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.87,
      "end_seconds": 247.62,
      "duration_seconds": 0.75,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.65,
      "end_seconds": 249.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "I've never smoked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.12,
      "end_seconds": 255.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "So, any allergies I should know about? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.49,
      "end_seconds": 260.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Yes, pollen, it gives me sneezing. Yes, latex."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.86,
      "end_seconds": 264.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 265.6,
      "end_seconds": 266.3,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.45,
      "end_seconds": 269.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Take a breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.13,
      "end_seconds": 281.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "There's a small scab where the cut was, no pus coming out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.58,
      "end_seconds": 285.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Can you lie back for me?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.73,
      "end_seconds": 300.54,
      "duration_seconds": 6.81,
      "text": "The skin on the lower leg is red, warm and swollen, about the size of my palm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.56,
      "end_seconds": 302.26,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.99,
      "end_seconds": 328.88,
      "duration_seconds": 21.89,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. Okay, so my impression is this: This looks most like cellulitis. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. I can't rule out a deep vein clot yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.99,
      "end_seconds": 337.45,
      "duration_seconds": 7.46,
      "text": "I'm going to order blood tests, for infection. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 337.77,
      "end_seconds": 339.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.85,
      "end_seconds": 354.07,
      "duration_seconds": 14.22,
      "text": "Let's get a wound swab, for infected wound. I'll start you on clindamycin, 300 milligrams, three times a day, for seven days. That should help with skin infection. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 354.94,
      "end_seconds": 357.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Okay, and I take that after food?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 358.69,
      "end_seconds": 370.58,
      "duration_seconds": 11.89,
      "text": "Keep the leg raised on a pillow when you're sitting. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 371.17,
      "end_seconds": 387.03,
      "duration_seconds": 15.86,
      "text": "Okay, I'm following. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 389.32,
      "end_seconds": 390.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 391.04,
      "end_seconds": 399.27,
      "duration_seconds": 8.23,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the redness spreads or the fever gets higher, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 400.32,
      "end_seconds": 402.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "Yes, I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 402.51,
      "end_seconds": 407.93,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "Come back in a week. Good. Call the clinic if you need us in the meantime."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 408.26,
      "end_seconds": 410.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Thanks so much, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 411.15,
      "end_seconds": 413.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Bye for now, look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}